

Papatono whakahaere-pūmahara: 4.

>> i := 0.
Huaputa tuhi: ['Can we count to 10 using a whileTrue loop ?'], rārangi-hou.
{ Huaputa tuhi: i, rārangi-hou. } i-te-wa: { i tāpiri: 1. <- (i ≤ 10). }.
Huaputa tuhi: ['Can we count back from 10 to 0 using a whileFalse loop ?'], rārangi-hou.
{ Huaputa tuhi: i, rārangi-hou. } i-te-wa: { i tango: 1. <- (i ≥ 0). }.
